# Direct runtime dependencies of the operator scripts under scripts/ (the theme
# pipeline, the maintenance scripts, the API client), at the versions the CI
# `python` job tests them on: every pin here, and every transitive pin in the
# compiled scripts/requirements.txt, must equal its pin in
# tests/requirements-ci.txt (tests/ci/test_requirements_locked.py checks it).
# The test-only packages (pytest) are not here.
# Edit THIS file, then recompile the hash-locked scripts/requirements.txt,
# constrained by the CI lock so the two cannot resolve apart:
#   uv pip compile scripts/requirements.in -o scripts/requirements.txt \
#     -c tests/requirements-ci.txt --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 --universal
# Install into a venv on the host that runs the scripts:
#   python3 -m venv .venv && .venv/bin/pip install --require-hashes \
#     --only-binary :all: -r scripts/requirements.txt
